To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool, access it at https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org and follow the quick start guide for setup with Claude Desktop, GitHub Copilot, or other MCP-compatible clients. Configure the tool by adding the VFB3-MCP server with the provided settings. The configuration settings to add are:
```
{
"mcpServers": {
"virtual-fly-brain": {
"type": "http",
"url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
"tools": ["*"]
}
}
}
```
Then, test the connection by asking AI assistant questions.
